        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Hyperorality is a condition characterized by an excessive preoccupation with oral sensations and behaviors, such as chewing, sucking, biting, swallowing, and excessive mouthing of objects.</babelon:source_value>
