        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A horizontal (flat) conformation of the ribs, the long curved bones that form the rib cage and normally progressively oblique (slanted) from ribs 1 through 9, then less slanted through rib 12.</babelon:source_value>
