        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of focal-onset seizure in which awareness is preserved. Awareness during a seizure is defined as the patient being fully aware of themself and their environment throughout the seizure, even if immobile.</babelon:source_value>
