        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormality of the morphology (structure) of the calvaria (skullcap), that is, of that part of the skull that is made up of the superior portions of the frontal bone, occipital bone, and parietal bones and covers the cranial cavity that contains the brain.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
