        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal form of vertebral body, which is the central cylindrical portion of the vertebra that together with other structures such as the vertebral arch, pedicles, laminae, spinous process, transverse processes, and articular facets makes up a vertebra.</babelon:source_value>
