        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Pili (from Latin pilus, hair) torti (from Latin tortus, twisted) refers to short and brittle hairs that appear flattened and twisted when viewed through a microscope.</babelon:source_value>
