        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Reduced functionality of the process in which a precursor cell type acquires the specialized features of a B cell. A B cell is a lymphocyte of B lineage with the phenotype CD19-positive and capable of B cell mediated immunity.</babelon:source_value>
