        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A limitation in the passive range of motion of a joint of the lower limb resulting from loss of elasticity in the periarticular tissues owing to structural changes of non-bony tissues, such as muscles, tendons, ligaments, joint capsules or skin.</babelon:source_value>
