        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Triangular shaped distal phalanx of the 3rd (middle) finger. A triangular or so called delta shaped phalanx is a typical result after a bracket epiphysis of the affected phalanx.</babelon:source_value>
