        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Triangular shaped phalanges of the 3rd finger. A triangular or so called delta shaped phalanx is a typical result after a bracket epiphysis of the affected phalanx.</babelon:source_value>
