        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Asymmetry observed in the face of a neonate or infant whose face appears symmetric at rest and asymmetric during crying as the mouth is pulled downward on one side while not moving on the other side.</babelon:source_value>
