        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An anomaly of the mitochondrion, the membranous cytoplasmic organelle the interior of which is subdivided by cristae. The mitochondrion is a self replicating organelle that is the site of tissue respiration.</babelon:source_value>
