        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An entrapment neuropathy of the ulnar nerve in the cubital tunnel (in the elbow) characterized by numbness in the ring and little fingers and weakness of the intrinsic muscles in the hand.</babelon:source_value>
