        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Increased plasma concentrations of chylomicrons, the large lipid droplet (up to 100 mm in diameter) of reprocessed lipid synthesized in epithelial cells of the small intestine and containing triacylglycerols, cholesterol esters, and several apolipoproteins.</babelon:source_value>
