        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An abnormal increase in intracellular lipid droplets In a muscle. The number and size of these drops can increase with somd disorders of lipid metabolism affecting muscle. See PMID 20691590 for histological images.</babelon:source_value>
