        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Origin of the right coronary artery (RCA) from the left sinus of Valsalva or of the left main (LM) or left anterior descending (LAD) coronary artery from the right sinus of Valsalva.</babelon:source_value>
