        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal decrease of the transitional B cell subpopulation, commonly characterized as CD27-CD24hiCD38hi or CD27-IgMhiCD38hi, measured as percentage of total B cells in the blood, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group.</babelon:source_value>
