    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031842">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="cs">Dilatace lymfatických cév, základní proces, který může vést ke vzniku lymfangiomu.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="cs">Lymfangiektázie</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Dilatace lymfatických cév, základní proces, který může vést ke vzniku lymfangiomu.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Dilation of the lymphatic vessels, the basic process that may result in the formation of a lymphangioma.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031842"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Lymfangiektázie</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Lymphangiectasis</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031843">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="cs">Abnormální pomalost myšlenkových procesů</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="cs">Bradyfrenie</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031843"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Abnormální pomalost myšlenkových procesů</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An inner sense from the self that thoughts are abnormally slow and the individual feels that they are unable to increase their rate of thinking. The primary pathology is the decreased rate and other qualities of thinking (e.g. naming of objects) are intact, just slowed. This may be associated with slowed speech, but may be internal and masked by speech that is limited to brief (yes or no) answers.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031843"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Bradyfrenie</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormally slow thought process</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031844">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="cs">Intenzivní pocit radosti nebo štěstí, které je nad rámec toho, co by se dalo očekávat za daných okolností</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="cs">Euforie</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031844"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Intenzivní pocit radosti nebo štěstí, které je nad rámec toho, co by se dalo očekávat za daných okolností</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Elevation of emotional tone or mood that significantly deviates from normative affective functioning. This state is characterized by an overwhelming and all-encompassing sense of joyous well-being; it is associated with unfounded grandiosity, or grossly inflated self-esteem, rapid speech, impulsivity, and an impaired capacity for self-regulation, irrespective of context.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031844"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Euforie</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Euphoria</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031845">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="cs">Jakákoli odchylka od normálního sexuálnícho chování nebo touhy po sexuální aktivitě</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="cs">Poruchy libida</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
