        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An anomaly of the hair follicles of the skin that typically presents as small, rough, brown folliculocentric papules distributed over characteristic areas of the skin, particularly the outer-upper arms and thighs.</babelon:source_value>
