        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Acellular collagenous matrix within Bowman&apos;s space, not associated with extracapillary hypercellularity or necrosis, associated with sclerosis or deflation of the tuft.</babelon:source_value>
