        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A pleural cobblestone appearance characterized by irregular bumps surrounded by depressed lines in open lung biopsy. Caused by underlying scarring causing retraction of the interlobular septa where they insert on the pleura.</babelon:source_value>
