        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A point of rupture in the glomerular basement membrane (GBM) where the discontinuous portions of GBM are still identifiable with a basement membrane stain such as Periodic acid Schiff (PAS) or silver.</babelon:source_value>
