        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="cs">Zvýšení hladiny non-HDL cholesterolu v krvi nad normální hodnoty. Non-HDL cholesterol je celkový cholesterol minus HDL-cholesterol (lipoprotein s vysokou hustotou).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Increase above normal levels of non-HDL cholesterol in the blood. Non-HDL cholesterol is total cholesterol minus high-density lipoprotein HDL-cholesterol (high-density lipoprotein-cholesterol).</babelon:source_value>
