        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A pervasive state of negatively valenced emotional unease and dissatisfaction along with an inner discomfort that is disproportionate to external circumstances and may include heightened emotional reactivity. It is associated with a mixture of overlapping negative emotions that are difficult to disentangle.</babelon:source_value>
