        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Juvenile granulosa cell tumor of the testis of neonates and infants is an uncommon lesion frequently associated with abnormal sex chromosome and ambiguous genitalia.</babelon:source_value>
