        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A lump in the region of the palate. A mass is any lump in the body that can be caused by the abnormal growth of cells, a cyst, hormonal changes or an immune reaction. Typically a mass is an initial finding that will lead to additional workup.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>cs</babelon:translation_language>
