        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Any deviation from the normal concentration of erythropoietin in the blood circulation. Erythropoietin is a glycoprotein hormone produced by the peritubular cells of the kidney that stimulates red blood cell production.</babelon:source_value>
