        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Deficiency of factor XIII subunit B, leading to a reduced factor XIII activity. Activated Factor XIII cross-links fibrin polymers solidifying the clot.</babelon:source_value>
