        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Coarse appearance of the components of the network of osseous tissue that makes up the cancellous structure of a bone, i.e., thickening of the (usually fine) white lines that are produced by trabeculae in radiograms.</babelon:source_value>
