        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Increased susceptibility to pharyngitis, as manifested by recurrent episodes of pharyngeal infection that are unusual in frequency or severity for a healthy individual of the same age.</babelon:source_value>
