        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Any abnormality in the activation of T cells, i.e. the change in morphology and behavior of a mature or immature T cell resulting from exposure to a mitogen, cytokine, chemokine, cellular ligand, or an antigen for which it is specific.</babelon:source_value>
