        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Concentration of biotinidase in the blood circulation below the lower limit of normal. Biotidinase is an enzyme that releases biotin from biocytin, the product of biotin-dependent carboxylases degradation.</babelon:source_value>
